  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>The grooming salon at 8 avenue de la République, in the east of Nice a few minutes from the harbour, is now part of the Nice brand Dog's Land. Its official website (dogsland.fr) lists it as its "grooming salon and concierge" at this address, with the same phone number as the former Au Paradis Canin salon (09 83 62 18 33), and still links to the "auparadiscanin06" Facebook page. Dog's Land also runs another salon on rue Acchiardi-de-Saint-Léger and a fitness centre by appointment.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>According to the Dog's Land website, this salon is open Tuesday to Saturday, 9am-12pm and 2pm-6pm. Call 09 83 62 18 33 to book and ask about prices.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you're looking for "Au Paradis Canin", this is it, under the Dog's Land name.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The harbour of Nice and its quays aren't far, a good opportunity to extend the outing once your dog is freshly groomed.</p>
